Package: markovteller
Type: Package
Title: Markov Chains for a Bank Queue
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Yeline", "Fawa", email = "fawayeline@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Builds the transition matrix of a Markov chain describing a bank
    with several tellers and priority customers. Computes the stationary
    distribution, waiting-time indicators (Little's law) and provides a
    Monte Carlo simulation for validation. The parameters shipped with the
    package are fictitious.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.0.0)
Imports: jsonlite, stats
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.1
